WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.858
At a fundraiser,
the most important moment might

00:00:02.872 --> 00:00:05.056
be the minute your guest
takes the microphone.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.221
What needs to happen
before that story can be heard?

00:00:08.481 --> 00:00:11.324
We work with your nonprofit
to define the program,

00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:14.195
sponsor opportunities and volunteer roles.

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:17.538
Your organization leads
the fundraising conversation.

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:21.521
Our producers select
and coordinate catering, décor,

00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:26.246
multimedia, staffing and logistics
partners around the approved scope.

00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:30.633
Everyone knows when to serve,
welcome a guest or open the floor.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.563
We bring experience from
over two hundred and fifty

00:00:33.577 --> 00:00:35.595
small and midsize events each year,

00:00:35.876 --> 00:00:37.466
in addition to our corporate work.

00:00:37.828 --> 00:00:42.897
For approved nonprofit partnerships,
the event system is included at no cost.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.160
Coordinate registration,
volunteers and sponsor activity,

00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:49.646
and keep using the tools between events.

00:00:49.906 --> 00:00:54.041
Tell us about your mission, your event
date and the support you already have.

00:00:54.444 --> 00:00:58.153
Together we can identify where
a production partner will help most.
